{"id":7924236714032,"title":"Absolute Drunk","handle":"absolute-drunk","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbsolute Drunk\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePersona\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA man who doesn’t follow the room… he owns it. Confident, charismatic, and unapologetically bold. The kind of presence that turns heads without trying. Nights, conversations, and moments seem to orbit around him.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Story\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAbsolute Drunk captures the intoxicating atmosphere of luxury evenings and unforgettable encounters. Inspired by the richness of oriental perfumery, it opens with a warm boozy sensation that immediately feels deep and addictive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAs the scent unfolds, rich patchouli and dark woods begin to dominate, creating a bold and mysterious character.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e In the dry down, smooth vanilla and warm amber and benzoin wrap the fragrance in a luxurious softness that lingers for hours.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis is a fragrance that feels powerful, seductive, and unforgettable.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTop Notes: Boozy accord with black currant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHeart Notes: Rich patchouli, dark woods, and oriental depth\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBase Notes: Vanilla, amber warmth, and smooth woody accords\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEvening wear and special occasions